    {
      "key": "oteryn:quest-npc/the_way_of_the_monk_quest/ambassador_manop/greeting-invitation",
      "quest": "oteryn:quest.the_way_of_the_monk_quest",
      "npc": "oteryn:npc.ambassador_manop",
      "trigger": "say",
      "keywords": [
        "hi",
        "hello"
      ],
      "guards": [
        {
          "kind": "storage",
          "track": "oteryn:quest-progress/quest/u15_00/the_way_of_the_monk/questline",
          "op": "lt",
          "value": 1
        }
      ],
      "reply": [
        "I welcome you, traveller of fate's unsearchable roads. On behalf of the {Merudri}, let this be an invitation from a humble guide along the way of enlightenment."
      ],
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "set_topic",
          "value": 1
        }
      ],
      "sources": [
        "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/ambassador_manop.lua:93"
      ],
      "keyword_mode": "exact"
    },
    {
      "key": "oteryn:quest-npc/the_way_of_the_monk_quest/ambassador_manop/greeting-seeker",
      "quest": "oteryn:quest.the_way_of_the_monk_quest",
      "npc": "oteryn:npc.ambassador_manop",
      "trigger": "say",
      "keywords": [
        "hi",
        "hello"
      ],
      "guards": [],
      "reply": [
        "I am glad you take your acquaintance, {seeker}. You must have a lot of questions for which I would gladly prove answers. If you are interested in joining us as a true warrior {monk}, just ask."
      ],
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "set_topic",
          "value": 0
        }
      ],
      "sources": [
        "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/ambassador_manop.lua:99"
      ],
      "keyword_mode": "exact"
    },
    {
      "key": "oteryn:quest-npc/the_way_of_the_monk_quest/ambassador_manop/information-job",
      "quest": "oteryn:quest.the_way_of_the_monk_quest",
      "npc": "oteryn:npc.ambassador_manop",
      "trigger": "say",
      "keywords": [
        "job"
      ],
      "guards": [],
      "reply": [
        "I am a {Merudri} ambassador. Sent from the heart of the {Blue Valley} I am stationed here to {guide} seekers on our path and {pilgrimage}.",
        "I have introduced myself as a guide: take my advice or choose a different path, you have every choice and every choice is yours. I can also provide assistance with magic {spells} for monks."
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "sources": [
        "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/ambassador_manop.lua:106"
      ],
      "keyword_mode": "exact"
    },
    {
      "key": "oteryn:quest-npc/the_way_of_the_monk_quest/ambassador_manop/information-legacy",
      "quest": "oteryn:quest.the_way_of_the_monk_quest",
      "npc": "oteryn:npc.ambassador_manop",
      "trigger": "say",
      "keywords": [
        "legacy"
      ],
      "guards": [],
      "reply": [
        "We are Merudri, warrior monks. Honing serenity, preserving our legacy, defending the {Blue Valley} and beyond."
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "sources": [
        "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/ambassador_manop.lua:114"
      ],
      "keyword_mode": "exact"
    },
    {
      "key": "oteryn:quest-npc/the_way_of_the_monk_quest/ambassador_manop/information-blue-valley",
      "quest": "oteryn:quest.the_way_of_the_monk_quest",
      "npc": "oteryn:npc.ambassador_manop",
      "trigger": "say",
      "keywords": [
        "blue valley"
      ],
      "guards": [],
      "reply": [
        "The Blue Valley is our ancestral home and heart of the {Merudri} culture, or what is left of it. Our ancestors from the Valley have long been separated from the true home of the {Merudri}."
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "sources": [
        "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/ambassador_manop.lua:119"
      ],
      "keyword_mode": "exact"
    },
    {
      "key": "oteryn:quest-npc/the_way_of_the_monk_quest/ambassador_manop/information-guide",
      "quest": "oteryn:quest.the_way_of_the_monk_quest",
      "npc": "oteryn:npc.ambassador_manop",
      "trigger": "say",
      "keywords": [
        "guide"
      ],
      "guards": [],
      "reply": [
        "I am here to communicate the ways and customs of the {Merudri} on our path to serenity. Please let me know if you are interested in our {pilgrimage}."
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "sources": [
        "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/ambassador_manop.lua:124"
      ],
      "keyword_mode": "exact"
    },
    {
      "key": "oteryn:quest-npc/the_way_of_the_monk_quest/ambassador_manop/information-monk",
      "quest": "oteryn:quest.the_way_of_the_monk_quest",
      "npc": "oteryn:npc.ambassador_manop",
      "trigger": "say",
      "keywords": [
        "monk"
      ],
      "guards": [],
      "reply": [
        "Look for the four shrines around the outpost and return to me after you have honoured the Merudri."
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "sources": [
        "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/ambassador_manop.lua:129"
      ],
      "keyword_mode": "exact"
    },
    {
      "key": "oteryn:quest-npc/the_way_of_the_monk_quest/ambassador_manop/information-serenity",
      "quest": "oteryn:quest.the_way_of_the_monk_quest",
      "npc": "oteryn:npc.ambassador_manop",
      "trigger": "say",
      "keywords": [
        "serenity"
      ],
      "guards": [],
      "reply": [
        "Harmony, enlightenment and power are the keys and control is the door to true serenity."
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "sources": [
        "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/ambassador_manop.lua:134"
      ],
      "keyword_mode": "exact"
    },
    {
      "key": "oteryn:quest-npc/the_way_of_the_monk_quest/ambassador_manop/information-dawnport",
      "quest": "oteryn:quest.the_way_of_the_monk_quest",
      "npc": "oteryn:npc.ambassador_manop",
      "trigger": "say",
      "keywords": [
        "dawnport"
      ],
      "guards": [],
      "reply": [
        "This place has been the starting point for many generations of heroes. Try to focus on learning the basics here and return to me once you found our {shrines} and are experienced enough to take on the {pilgrimage}."
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "sources": [
        "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/ambassador_manop.lua:139"
      ],
      "keyword_mode": "exact"
    },
    {
      "key": "oteryn:quest-npc/the_way_of_the_monk_quest/ambassador_manop/information-shrine",
      "quest": "oteryn:quest.the_way_of_the_monk_quest",
      "npc": "oteryn:npc.ambassador_manop",
      "trigger": "say",
      "keywords": [
        "shrine"
      ],
      "guards": [],
      "reply": [
        "The shrines you can find here are part of the Three-Fold Path. They are the first stage of this {pilgrimage} that every {monk} must undertake."
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "sources": [
        "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/ambassador_manop.lua:144"
      ],
      "keyword_mode": "exact"
    },
    {
      "key": "oteryn:quest-npc/the_way_of_the_monk_quest/ambassador_manop/information-enpa",
